  "body": "https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/e88a63efc4663eedc6cb3081002c26935014c25d/#map-exists\r\n\r\n> contains an entry with a given key\r\n\r\nThe above definition (for map and others) has an `lt=\"exists | contains\"`. This interfere's with Bikeshed's ability to conjugate the words when autolinking; for example, it can't match this with a \"containing\" autolink.  Both of these words should be in their base form: `lt=\"exist | contain\"`.",
